  "note": "The proof of Prop 9.4.2 (expform.tex:1661) cites (A.3) for η₊(0) = 0. Lean's bounds on η₊ hold for H = 200 only and have cruder constants: Helfgott.abs_etaPlus_le_A gives |η₊| ≤ 1.94, against 1.079955 from (A.38)/(14.3)."
